EXPORTS
; Only these two are fetched by name (imagenation_OpenLibrary -> GetProcAddress
; "OpenLibrary"; CloseLibrary at shutdown). MicroMill/PXC200_Support bind every
; other PXC function through the vtable OpenLibrary installs, so they need no
; named export. MSVC strips the stdcall decoration and exports _OpenLibrary@8
; as "OpenLibrary" and _CloseLibrary@4 as "CloseLibrary".
  OpenLibrary
  CloseLibrary
